{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_meta": {
    "source": "MAngband 1.5.3 monster death-drop flags",
    "description": "Canonical reusable monster loot profiles. DROP_60 and DROP_90 remain independent bonus rules; equivalent Xd2 rules are combined only when dice sides are identical; DROP_CHOSEN is represented as a special reward rather than normal generation; DROP_USEFUL is preserved only as optional metadata because it does not affect loot generation.",
    "schema_path": "data/schemas/monsters/monster_loot.schema.json",
    "notes": [
      "drop_kind mirrors ONLY_ITEM and ONLY_GOLD restrictions, defaulting to mixed when neither restriction exists.",
      "generation_rules preserves staged GOOD and GREAT semantics rather than flattening them into a single quality value.",
      "Generated profiles: 61; monsters migrated from legacy loot flags: 344; every monster references one profile.",
      "DROP_USEFUL is omitted unless present in source data; it has no runtime loot generation behavior.",
      "Morgoth uses special_rewards: [\"morgoth_victory\"] to preserve DROP_CHOSEN behavior outside normal random loot generation."
    ]
  },
